6. Character base assets and motion capture (external cooked banks)
===================================================================

MakeHuman / MPFB2 System Assets, CC0 1.0:
  Human base meshes, rig templates, skins, eyes and facial hair assets
  authored headlessly via tools/characters/author_mpfb2.py.

Tripo H3.1 modular wardrobe kit (external drafts/clean assets on E:):
  Jacket, boot and satchel source geometry generated with Tripo H3.1 from
  clean studio reference images, locally welded and decimated into semantic
  PBR material classes (no raw generated atlases) via
  tools/characters/prepare_wardrobe_kit.py.

Carnegie Mellon University Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (BVH):
  The data used in this project was obtained from mocap.cs.cmu.edu.
  The database was created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.
  Converted BVH mirror: https://github.com/una-dinosauria/cmu-mocap.
  Retargeted offline onto Exolune's canonical skeleton via
  tools/characters/retarget_mocap.py and cooked into .ozz clips.
